## Inspired Tours

Procedurally generated environments capturing the character of a region.

Examples:

Tokyo Night Drive  
Tuscan Countryside  
Swiss Mountain Pass

Easier to create.

---

## Landmark Tours

More carefully modeled routes containing recognizable real locations.

Examples:

