# 15. AI Agent Integration

Agentic development is especially suited to VibeTour.

Agents should appear as meaningful cockpit entities.

For automotive mode:

Main agent = driver/copilot computer

Background agents = mirrors/dashboard indicators

For aviation mode:

User = captain

Primary coding agent = copilot

Specialist agents = crew

Examples:

NAV — planning

ENG — code

QA — testing

COMMS — documentation/search

OPS — deployment

Users should be able to inspect an agent by selecting its instrument.

