BYOK should be a major VibeTour feature.

Users can connect supported video-generation providers.

VibeTour then serves as the orchestration layer.

The user pays the generation provider directly.

VibeTour supplies:

- prompt design
- scene decomposition
- route planning
- reference-image creation
- continuity management
- generation retries
- asset organization
- Journey Pack assembly

This avoids VibeTour carrying all generation costs.

VibeTour can still offer hosted generation later for users who prefer simplicity.

